── SYNTAX ERROR ────── E0100_optional_type_with_a_question_mark.lt:1:31  [E0100]

Stilt writes a type whose value may be missing as `Option<T>`:

  1 │ fn first(xs: List<i64>) -> i64? { xs.first() }
    │                               ^

A value that may be missing has the type `Option<T>`: `None`, or `Some(x)`.

To fix it, write `Option<…>`:

  1 │ fn first(xs: List<i64>) -> Option<i64> { xs.first() }
    │                            +++++++   ~
